{"name":"Blue Bazaar","hex":"#017cb8","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"},{"term":"bazaar","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A marketplace, particularly in the Middle East and South Asia, and often covered with shops and stalls.","A shop selling articles that are either exotic or eclectic."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bazaar"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bazaar","blocks":[{"text":"A bazaar or souk is a marketplace consisting of multiple small stalls or shops, especially in West Asia, North Africa, the Balkans, Central Asia, and South Asia. They are traditionally located in vaulted or covered streets that have doors on each end and served as a city's central marketplace."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Turkey_%2868742801%29.jpeg/330px-Turkey_%2868742801%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bazaar","wikidata":"Q219760"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Sanandaj_Bazaar.jpg/500px-Sanandaj_Bazaar.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Sanandaj_Bazaar.jpg/1280px-Sanandaj_Bazaar.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Sanandaj_Bazaar.jpg/500px-Sanandaj_Bazaar.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bazaar in Sanandaj, Iran","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASanandaj_Bazaar.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/PS-Amman_6501.JPG/500px-PS-Amman_6501.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/PS-Amman_6501.JPG/1280px-PS-Amman_6501.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/PS-Amman_6501.JPG/500px-PS-Amman_6501.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Souk in Amman, Jordan","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APS-Amman_6501.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Mahane_Yehuda_%28I%29_%2845298221191%29.jpg/500px-Mahane_Yehuda_%28I%29_%2845298221191%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Mahane_Yehuda_%28I%29_%2845298221191%29.jpg/1280px-Mahane_Yehuda